WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:05.140
<i>In the second half, Meiwa put
their ferocious tiger out on the field.</i>

00:10.020 --> 00:11.840
<i>They steadily drove Nankatsu into a corner,</i>

00:11.840 --> 00:14.240
<i>and finally managed to catch up to them.</i>

00:15.110 --> 00:20.820
<i>Nankatsu SC rallied, staving off Meiwa FC's fierce attack as their entire team comes together to defend.</i>

00:20.820 --> 00:25.710
<i>And in doing so, finally, the player they've
most relied on, Misaki, has returned</i>

00:25.710 --> 00:28.460
<i>after getting his leg injury treated.</i>

00:28.460 --> 00:29.840
Misaki...

00:29.840 --> 00:32.630
I know what you're thinking, Tsubasa.

00:32.630 --> 00:35.510
I will steal the ball and pass it to you for sure.

00:36.570 --> 00:40.550
<i>Tsubasa's counterattack starts now!</i>

00:40.550 --> 00:41.880
Misaki!

00:41.880 --> 00:43.450
We're counting on you, Misaki!

00:43.450 --> 00:45.310
Good luck, Misaki!

00:45.310 --> 00:47.380
Coach, are you sure about this...?

00:47.380 --> 00:50.920
He will be transferring away after this match.

00:50.920 --> 00:52.740
They're making lasting memories, here.

00:52.740 --> 00:54.240
He wants to play. Let him.

00:54.240 --> 00:55.820
But—

00:55.820 --> 00:59.320
Misaki thinks about the team the most.

00:59.320 --> 01:01.920
If he can't play as he wants to because of his injury,

01:01.920 --> 01:04.230
and realizes he's being a burden to his team,

01:04.230 --> 01:07.040
he himself will ask to be taken off the pitch.

01:07.040 --> 01:07.840
Let's do this!

01:07.840 --> 01:10.920
No matter what, we'll meet up with Hyuga in front of the goal.

01:15.300 --> 01:16.770
Misaki!

01:18.360 --> 01:19.640
Taro...

01:19.640 --> 01:23.580
<i>Misaki, your injury was worse than mine.</i>

01:23.580 --> 01:27.270
<i>Yet you are bearing with the pain,
and are trying to pass the ball to me.</i>

01:27.270 --> 01:29.960
<i>To match your fighting spirit...</i>

01:29.960 --> 01:32.900
<i>I'll definitely end this with a goal!</i>

01:46.060 --> 01:51.670
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

01:46.060 --> 01:51.670
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

01:51.670 --> 01:56.720
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

01:51.670 --> 01:56.720
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

01:57.390 --> 02:02.520
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

01:57.390 --> 02:02.520
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:03.270 --> 02:10.860
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:03.270 --> 02:10.860
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:10.860 --> 02:16.630
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:10.860 --> 02:16.630
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:16.630 --> 02:25.130
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:16.630 --> 02:25.130
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:25.130 --> 02:30.920
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:25.130 --> 02:30.920
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:30.920 --> 02:36.850
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:30.920 --> 02:36.850
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:36.850 --> 02:38.390
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:38.390 --> 02:45.680
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:38.390 --> 02:45.680
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

02:45.680 --> 02:48.600
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

02:45.680 --> 02:48.600
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

02:48.600 --> 02:53.530
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

02:48.600 --> 02:53.530
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:04.240 --> 03:09.240
<b><b>EPISODE 25:
COUNTERATTACK ON FIRE</b></b>

03:06.740 --> 03:09.750
<i>In order to prevent a cross reaching Hyuga at all costs,</i>

03:09.750 --> 03:12.330
<i>Misaki is tenaciously marking Sawada!</i>

03:14.330 --> 03:15.380
Misaki...

03:16.060 --> 03:18.420
<i>Sawada is the heart of the midfield.</i>

03:18.420 --> 03:22.760
<i>When he's being pushed down,
Meiwa's attack just can't take form.</i>

03:23.880 --> 03:27.660
<i>Misaki's injury is my fault...</i>

03:27.660 --> 03:30.040
<i>But that was just inevitable!</i>

03:30.480 --> 03:32.230
<i>I won't hold back against you!</i>

03:33.520 --> 03:35.270
<i>Sawada feints!</i>

03:37.080 --> 03:38.400
<i>And a one-two!</i>

03:38.400 --> 03:39.820
<i>He got through Misaki!</i>

03:39.820 --> 03:41.300
<i>Damn it!</i>

03:41.300 --> 03:42.780
<i>I have to mark Kojiro now!</i>

03:43.780 --> 03:44.940
<i>That's right.</i>

03:44.940 --> 03:49.150
<i>My one and only goal right now is to send a pass to Hyuga.</i>

03:49.150 --> 03:50.940
For Meiwa's victory,

03:50.940 --> 03:52.580
I trust you, Hyuga!

03:54.000 --> 03:54.750
Crap!

03:54.750 --> 03:56.920
Nice pass, Takeshi!

03:57.820 --> 04:00.590
<i>Misaki returns and tenaciously cuts the pass!</i>

04:00.590 --> 04:01.460
What?!

04:01.460 --> 04:03.630
<i>But, the ball is deflected above Hyuga!</i>

04:03.630 --> 04:05.180
<i>It's not over yet!</i>

04:05.180 --> 04:06.090
Let's clear it!

04:06.740 --> 04:08.160
Damn!

04:08.160 --> 04:10.060
<i>Hyuga goes for a jumping header!</i>

04:11.580 --> 04:15.000
<i>Wakabayashi is able to parry it with a punch!</i>

04:15.000 --> 04:17.660
<i>Neither of these players is willing to give up!</i>

04:18.900 --> 04:19.730
<i>This is it!</i>

04:23.940 --> 04:25.410
Tsubasa!

04:25.410 --> 04:29.240
<i>Misaki forcefully clears the loose ball with his injured right leg!</i>

04:31.560 --> 04:34.540
<i>It's a perfect pass for Tsubasa!</i>

04:34.540 --> 04:35.700
<i>Misaki...!</i>

04:35.700 --> 04:37.810
<i>There's no one marking him!</i>

04:37.810 --> 04:40.540
<i>And since he's in his side of the field, there's no offside!</i>

04:40.540 --> 04:44.050
Is that it? Is this what Tsubasa was after?

04:44.050 --> 04:47.300
<i>It is time for Nankatsu's counterattack!</i>

04:47.300 --> 04:48.640
Oh, crap!

04:48.640 --> 04:49.300
Tsubasa...!

04:50.270 --> 04:52.060
I'm counting on you, Tsubasa.

04:52.060 --> 04:56.640
<i>As though he'd been saving all
of his energy for this sudden explosion,</i>

04:56.640 --> 05:01.400
<i>Tsubasa vigorously dribbles towards his opponent's goal!</i>

05:01.400 --> 05:06.530
<i>Conversely, Meiwa's been so fixated on attacking, that their defense is in complete disarray!</i>

05:06.530 --> 05:07.390
<i>Damn it!</i>

05:07.390 --> 05:10.530
<i>If only I'd realized sooner, I could have given orders!</i>

05:10.530 --> 05:12.540
<i>Even if it becomes a one-on-one battle,</i>

05:12.540 --> 05:14.910
<i>no matter his approach, I'll stop him somehow!</i>

05:14.910 --> 05:16.920
All right! Go, do it!

05:16.920 --> 05:18.790
Tsubasa, we trust you!

05:20.210 --> 05:21.840
<i>My leg...!</i>

05:21.840 --> 05:26.840
<i>Both Wakabayashi and Misaki are playing
while enduring this kind of pain.</i>

05:26.840 --> 05:28.220
<i>I can do it, too!</i>

05:28.220 --> 05:29.130
<i>This can't happen!</i>

05:29.130 --> 05:31.350
<i>It'll be really bad if we give up a goal here!</i>

05:31.350 --> 05:33.140
I'm counting on you, Takeshi!

05:33.140 --> 05:35.140
This is the match point!

05:35.140 --> 05:37.640
This encounter will decide the outcome of this match.

05:38.240 --> 05:40.230
<i>Tsubasa prepares to shoot!</i>

05:40.230 --> 05:41.730
I'll definitely stop him!

05:43.800 --> 05:45.910
<i>Sawada catches up with him!</i>

05:45.910 --> 05:48.400
<i>He stops Tsubasa's shot with a sliding tackle.</i>

05:50.530 --> 05:53.410
<i>Tsubasa takes a powerful shot from mid-distance!</i>

05:54.800 --> 05:57.080
<i>Wakashimazu's arm barely deflects the ball!</i>

05:57.080 --> 05:58.910
<i>Those are some crazy reflexes!</i>

06:00.290 --> 06:03.960
<i>But there's still some strength left in Tsubasa's shot!</i>

06:03.960 --> 06:05.960
<i>Will this be the tie-breaker goal?</i>

06:07.630 --> 06:12.930
<i>Wakashimazu turns his body 180 degrees and uses a karate back kick to kick the ball away!</i>

06:14.430 --> 06:20.690
<i>Even after this counterattack plan, it seems as if
Nankatsu's ace Tsubasa is unable to score a goal!</i>

06:20.690 --> 06:22.690
Well done, Wakashimazu!

06:22.690 --> 06:24.190
Tsubasa...

06:24.190 --> 06:26.560
He was so close...

06:26.560 --> 06:27.570
Tsubasa...

06:29.130 --> 06:31.070
Not yet!

06:31.070 --> 06:33.430
Tsubasa's still in front of the goal!

06:33.430 --> 06:35.950
We'll pass the ball to Tsubasa once more!

06:35.950 --> 06:38.660
Don't let Nankatsu get the ball!

06:38.660 --> 06:41.420
<i>It's another battle in the midfield!</i>

06:41.420 --> 06:44.170
Leave all the heading to me!

06:45.390 --> 06:48.170
<i>Izawa wins the heading battle!</i>

06:49.260 --> 06:50.050
All right!

06:50.050 --> 06:51.440
We won't let you through!

06:51.440 --> 06:54.510
Meiwa's sliding force attacks!

06:54.510 --> 06:57.260
Eat this!

06:59.810 --> 07:00.890
Get the ball!

07:00.890 --> 07:02.060
Don't let them have it!

07:02.060 --> 07:04.070
<i>It's a huge midfield duel between both teams!</i>

07:04.070 --> 07:06.210
<i>Will the ball find its way to Hyuga?</i>

07:06.210 --> 07:08.070
<i>Or will it get to Tsubasa?</i>

07:08.070 --> 07:09.850
Hang in there, Nankatsu!

07:09.850 --> 07:11.320
Get it to Tsubasa!

07:11.320 --> 07:12.830
Persevere, Meiwa!

07:12.830 --> 07:13.950
We're counting on you!

07:14.610 --> 07:16.280
<i>We're in the final stage of this match.</i>

07:16.280 --> 07:18.950
<i>Only 5 minutes remain.</i>

07:19.580 --> 07:21.350
<i>It's a high ball!</i>

07:21.350 --> 07:23.000
<i>Who will be recovering it?</i>

07:24.650 --> 07:25.500
Hyuga!

07:25.500 --> 07:27.210
<i>Meiwa was a second faster!</i>

07:27.210 --> 07:28.130
Damn!

07:28.130 --> 07:30.510
<i>The ball directly goes to the front line.</i>

07:30.510 --> 07:31.170
Guys...!

07:31.690 --> 07:34.180
<i>The ball reaches Hyuga!</i>

07:34.180 --> 07:37.180
<i>Only Misaki and Wakabayashi stand in his way!</i>

07:37.180 --> 07:38.720
<i>Kojiro...</i>

07:39.390 --> 07:40.950
<i>Misaki!</i>

07:40.950 --> 07:43.270
<i>Hey, see that?</i>

07:40.950 --> 07:43.270
MUNICIPAL MEIWA ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

07:43.270 --> 07:47.020
<i>Look at how Misaki dribbles. He's the guy who transferred yesterday.</i>

07:51.570 --> 07:54.250
<i>Wow, you have amazing technique.</i>

07:54.250 --> 07:55.720
<i>I give up! I give up!</i>

07:55.720 --> 07:58.410
<i>Teach me those cool moves too!</i>

07:58.410 --> 07:59.560
<i>Okay!</i>

08:00.870 --> 08:04.230
<i>There's no need to learn such silly tricks.</i>

08:04.230 --> 08:05.370
<i>Hyuga!</i>

08:05.370 --> 08:08.600
<i>What use is it to just dart around like that?</i>

08:08.600 --> 08:09.170
<i>Eh?!</i>

08:09.170 --> 08:11.920
<i>You run straight if you get the ball.</i>

08:11.920 --> 08:14.090
<i>You just blow away anyone that gets in your way,</i>

08:14.090 --> 08:16.510
<i>and advance directly towards the goal!</i>

08:16.510 --> 08:18.970
<i>Got it?</i>

08:27.400 --> 08:29.520
<i>Will Hyuga get past him using sheer force?</i>

08:29.520 --> 08:32.000
<i>Or will Misaki stop him with his technique?</i>

08:32.000 --> 08:33.660
<i>I won't let you pass, Kojiro!</i>

08:33.660 --> 08:36.070
<i>Blow me away if you can!</i>

08:36.070 --> 08:37.660
<i>Misaki!</i>

08:37.660 --> 08:38.950
Brother!

08:43.300 --> 08:48.330
<i>Hyuga evaded Misaki's charge by jumping to the side.</i>

08:48.330 --> 08:48.830
<i>Eh?!</i>

08:48.830 --> 08:49.840
What?!

08:49.840 --> 08:54.790
<i>Hyuga, who always chooses to go straight through his opponent and to blow them away,</i>

08:54.790 --> 08:56.470
<i>uses a feint for the first time!</i>

08:57.510 --> 09:00.100
<i>Hyuga loses his balance!</i>

09:00.100 --> 09:01.620
It's a one-on-one duel!

09:01.620 --> 09:03.350
I have to stop him here!

09:03.350 --> 09:06.890
<i>Hyuga regains his balance and gets in position to shoot.</i>

09:09.220 --> 09:11.730
<i>Both players move almost at the same time!</i>

09:32.000 --> 09:33.800
You did it, bro!

09:35.840 --> 09:37.320
Kojiro!

09:38.340 --> 09:40.850
You did it! You finally did it!

09:40.850 --> 09:44.100
<i>Meiwa finally manages to turn the tables!</i>

09:44.100 --> 09:46.240
<i>With just 4 minutes left this second half,</i>

09:46.240 --> 09:48.600
<i>this goal is nothing short of decisive!</i>

09:50.040 --> 09:51.810
Damn you, Hyuga!

09:51.810 --> 09:53.320
Hyuga!

09:55.680 --> 10:00.470
<i>This is the same pose Hyuga struck right before the tournament,</i>

10:00.470 --> 10:02.990
<i>declaring his own victory!</i>

10:02.990 --> 10:05.870
<i>I have won this game!</i>

10:15.320 --> 10:17.260
<i>Just as the end of the match approaches,</i>

10:17.260 --> 10:22.050
<i>Meiwa have finally taken the lead over Nankatsu with Hyuga's goal.</i>

10:22.050 --> 10:24.050
<i>Okay, we can do it!</i>

10:24.050 --> 10:26.560
<i>The pennant is as good as ours with this.</i>

10:26.560 --> 10:29.360
<i>This goal was a huge blow.</i>

10:29.360 --> 10:32.060
<i>And not just because it happened near the end of the game.</i>

10:32.520 --> 10:37.860
<i>Just as Nankatsu is formed around
Tsubasa, Misaki and Wakabayashi as the core,</i>

10:37.860 --> 10:41.610
<i>with the rest of the team filling in the blanks,</i>

10:41.780 --> 10:46.320
<i>Meiwa is formed around Hyuga, Sawada and Wakashimazu,</i>

10:46.320 --> 10:49.040
<i>and the rest of the team support them.</i>

10:49.040 --> 10:51.920
<i>In the last showdown, Meiwa stopped the opposing ace, Tsubasa,</i>

10:52.000 --> 10:55.580
<i>with Sawada and Wakashimazu.</i>

10:55.580 --> 11:00.080
<i>Moreover, in the mid-field battle, where there are no standout players we can consider as a core,</i>

11:00.080 --> 11:01.470
<i>Meiwa was the winning side.</i>

11:01.550 --> 11:04.140
<i>And then, in front of Nankatsu goal,</i>

11:04.140 --> 11:07.890
<i>Hyuga broke the wall Wakabayashi and Misaki formed.</i>

11:07.930 --> 11:12.690
<i>In other words, this goal is a signifier that Meiwa has outdone Nankatsu</i>

11:12.690 --> 11:15.690
<i>in terms of their overall team strength.</i>

11:15.690 --> 11:18.190
<i>What will you do now, Tsubasa?</i>

11:19.030 --> 11:20.400
We did it, no?

11:19.340 --> 11:21.130
It was a nice shot, Hyuga.

11:21.130 --> 11:21.900
What?

11:22.580 --> 11:25.490
But let me remind you, the match isn't over yet.

11:27.620 --> 11:28.910
Tsubasa...

11:29.350 --> 11:32.210
He is right, I can still fight too.

11:32.210 --> 11:34.820
It's not like we've lost.

11:34.820 --> 11:35.460
Yeah.

11:35.460 --> 11:40.340
We've overcome this hurdle countless times until now, and won.

11:40.340 --> 11:42.470
We won't lose yet, Meiwa.

11:42.470 --> 11:43.980
Guys...

11:43.980 --> 11:47.300
Wakabayashi, spare gloves for you.

11:47.300 --> 11:49.220
Thank you, Morisaki.

11:49.220 --> 11:51.430
Wakabayashi, how is your leg doing?

11:51.430 --> 11:54.230
Also, that clash...

11:54.230 --> 11:55.240
Don't mention it.

11:55.240 --> 11:56.980
It's nothing.

11:56.980 --> 11:59.980
You guys fought hard until now too.

11:59.980 --> 12:03.660
In these last 4 minutes, I'm counting on you guys to cheer for our victory.

12:03.660 --> 12:04.860
Sure.

12:04.860 --> 12:08.240
It's just as Tsubasa said:
this is the moment of truth.

12:08.240 --> 12:11.000
The real battle.

12:11.000 --> 12:14.140
You've got some great friends, Tsubasa.

12:16.000 --> 12:18.920
Listen to me guys, don't relax just yet.

12:18.920 --> 12:21.760
Nankatsu truly is a tough opponent when cornered.

12:21.760 --> 12:22.720
Yes!

12:22.720 --> 12:24.720
<i>Like I'd hand it over to you.</i>

12:24.720 --> 12:29.220
<i>I went as far as to throw away my pride away to get that goal.</i>

12:29.220 --> 12:34.600
That one goal is an important one,
as it really shows Hyuga's growth this match.

12:35.640 --> 12:38.620
Hyuga, who only forced his way through until now,

12:38.620 --> 12:41.160
used some finesse for the first time.

12:41.160 --> 12:43.160
That brute, force-oriented boy,

12:43.160 --> 12:47.360
ditched his stubbornness for the sake of his team's victory.

12:47.360 --> 12:51.370
<i>Tsubasa, try and answer this goal.</i>

12:51.370 --> 12:54.400
<i>Less than 4 minutes are left in the match.</i>

12:54.400 --> 12:57.630
<i>Will Nankatsu be able to tie the game?</i>

13:00.120 --> 13:01.560
Let's go, Misaki!

13:01.560 --> 13:02.210
Yeah!

13:02.210 --> 13:03.140
Stick to them!

13:03.140 --> 13:05.840
Don't ever leave Tsubasa and Misaki unmarked!

13:05.840 --> 13:06.680
Okay!

13:06.680 --> 13:09.260
<i>Meiwa goes to mark those two, as expected!</i>

13:13.420 --> 13:17.500
Now that Tsubasa and Misaki are injured, we need to step up!

13:18.600 --> 13:20.740
<i>Here is Nankatsu's final struggle!</i>

13:20.740 --> 13:24.530
<i>With their tenacious team play, they carry the ball to the Meiwa goal.</i>

13:24.530 --> 13:26.820
All right! Go Nankatsu!

13:26.820 --> 13:28.960
Squeeze out the last of your strength!

13:28.960 --> 13:31.330
Make sure you score, make it even!

13:31.330 --> 13:36.910
<i>Under the loud cheers, how will Nankatsu create an opening?</i>

13:41.090 --> 13:44.640
<i>In any other situation, I would get past
the opponent and just fire away.</i>

13:44.640 --> 13:46.700
<i>But the keeper is Wakashimazu.</i>

13:46.700 --> 13:48.180
<i>I can't shoot from out here.</i>

13:49.320 --> 13:51.260
<i>Tsubasa sends the ball to the right.</i>

13:51.260 --> 13:53.110
<i>Izawa takes the ball there.</i>

13:53.110 --> 13:55.220
<i>Is he going to go for a surprise long shot?</i>

13:55.220 --> 13:56.980
<i>Come at me if you will!</i>

13:56.980 --> 14:01.050
<i>At this range, my shot wouldn't be effective.</i>

14:02.310 --> 14:03.020
Taki!

14:05.030 --> 14:06.390
<i>Should I shoot?</i>

14:06.390 --> 14:07.950
<i>No, let's cross instead...</i>

14:07.950 --> 14:10.270
<i>But, even if I send the ball high over the goal,</i>

14:10.270 --> 14:13.120
<i>Wakashimazu might still come out to intercept it.</i>

14:13.120 --> 14:14.120
<i>Damn!</i>

14:14.120 --> 14:16.300
<i>He passes the ball back!</i>

14:17.000 --> 14:18.060
<i>It's no good.</i>

14:18.060 --> 14:21.320
<i>We're just spending what precious time we have left like this.</i>

14:21.320 --> 14:24.590
<i>There are only 3 minutes left!
Not much time remains!</i>

14:24.590 --> 14:25.460
Damn!

14:25.460 --> 14:29.800
We are in front of the goal and have possession, but how is it that we can't even shoot...?!

14:29.800 --> 14:30.510
We'll take that!

14:30.510 --> 14:32.670
<i>Meiwa's passionate defense is closing in!</i>

14:32.670 --> 14:34.180
<i>What will Misaki do?</i>

14:34.180 --> 14:36.510
<i>Certainly, Meiwa's defense's is passionate...</i>

14:36.510 --> 14:39.710
<i>But if we can't shoot, we can't score.</i>

14:39.710 --> 14:43.230
<i>The only one who can shoot the ball now is you, Tsubasa!</i>

14:44.480 --> 14:47.820
Shoot the ball! Only you can do it!

14:47.820 --> 14:49.220
He is right, Tsubasa!

14:49.220 --> 14:53.570
You are the only one we can count on
at this point for this, Tsubasa!

14:53.570 --> 14:55.950
<i>Misaki, everyone...</i>

14:57.080 --> 14:59.040
<i>Okay, let's go!</i>

15:00.040 --> 15:02.000
<i>Tsubasa jumps!</i>

15:02.000 --> 15:03.080
<i>This is...</i>

15:03.080 --> 15:04.130
I will catch that!

15:04.130 --> 15:07.270
<i>Here comes Tsubasa's favorite move!</i>

15:07.270 --> 15:10.880
<i>Will this be an Overhead Kick of revival with a score?!</i>

15:12.040 --> 15:14.600
Go!

15:14.600 --> 15:15.500
Tsubasa!

15:15.500 --> 15:16.430
Wakashimazu!

15:17.180 --> 15:18.060
I'll get it!

15:19.100 --> 15:20.820
<i>He caught it!</i>

15:20.820 --> 15:23.310
<i>Nankatsu couldn't tie it up!</i>

15:23.310 --> 15:24.900
You did it Wakashimazu!

15:26.820 --> 15:27.570
I'm on it!

15:27.570 --> 15:28.650
Like hell you are!

15:29.880 --> 15:32.320
<i>Wakashimazu clears the ball quickly!</i>

15:32.320 --> 15:35.280
<i>And that ball goes towards...</i>

15:35.280 --> 15:37.280
<i>We did it! The win is ours!</i>

15:37.280 --> 15:39.540
<i>There's just one minute left in the match!</i>

15:39.540 --> 15:41.790
<i>If Hyuga can manage to hold on to the ball,</i>

15:41.790 --> 15:44.380
<i>the match is as good as won for them!</i>

15:44.380 --> 15:45.790
Okay!

15:47.170 --> 15:48.000
What?!

15:48.000 --> 15:49.900
<i>Wakabayashi!</i>

15:49.900 --> 15:54.720
<i>T-this is...! Nankatsu's goalkeeper Wakabayashi
has stolen the ball with a risky overlap!</i>

15:54.720 --> 15:56.140
Wakabayashi!

15:56.140 --> 15:57.760
Stubborn bastards...!

15:57.760 --> 16:02.350
<i>Wakabayashi dribbles all the way into Meiwa's side of the field!</i>

16:02.350 --> 16:04.560
<i>There's less than a minute left!</i>

16:04.560 --> 16:08.130
<i>It looks like Nankatsu had one more chance left after all!</i>

16:08.130 --> 16:09.110
<i>Genzo...</i>

16:09.110 --> 16:12.370
<i>Even the goalkeeper, Wakabayashi, is participating in the offense!</i>

16:12.370 --> 16:16.620
<i>This will truly be their final attack,
with all 11 players pushing forward!</i>

16:16.620 --> 16:19.370
<i>I let Hyuga score twice against me.</i>

16:19.370 --> 16:24.620
<i>At least, let me end this by making up for this mess I put us in!</i>

16:24.620 --> 16:29.210
<i>Wakabayashi is positioned to shoot from long distance!</i>

16:29.210 --> 16:30.460
<i>Let's go!</i>

16:31.630 --> 16:33.530
<i>Meiwa's defense can't react in time!</i>

16:33.530 --> 16:37.850
<i>Wakabayashi lets off a fateful long shot
with every ounce of his strength!</i>

16:37.850 --> 16:40.370
Long shots don't work against me!

16:40.370 --> 16:41.470
I'll catch it!

16:41.470 --> 16:42.470
Misaki!

16:42.470 --> 16:43.060
Okay!

16:44.680 --> 16:47.890
<i>Misaki makes a jump enduring his injured leg!</i>

16:47.890 --> 16:49.690
<i>He changed the shot trajectory!</i>

16:49.690 --> 16:50.570
Crap!

16:50.570 --> 16:51.260
He did it!

16:51.260 --> 16:52.190
Misaki!

16:53.400 --> 16:55.650
<i>The ball is off target!</i>

16:55.650 --> 16:56.450
Yes!

16:56.450 --> 16:57.660
It's a bad shot!

16:57.660 --> 16:59.120
Was it no good...?!

16:59.580 --> 17:02.450
<i>Tsubasa takes a raging leap!</i>

17:02.450 --> 17:04.080
<i>But it looks much too short!</i>

17:04.080 --> 17:06.120
<i>It's much too far!</i>

17:06.120 --> 17:10.630
<i>My Overhead Kick that everyone was counting on was soundly defeated.</i>

17:10.630 --> 17:16.970
<i>But, for the sake of Wakabayashi and Misaki, who made this single opportunity possible...</i>

17:17.700 --> 17:22.060
<i>I will use this chance to score, no matter the cost!</i>

17:22.060 --> 17:25.350
<i>Tsubasa is using his left hand to spring off the ground!</i>

17:26.340 --> 17:29.230
<i>He flips forward, managing to reach the ball!</i>

17:30.230 --> 17:31.730
Go!

17:31.730 --> 17:34.400
<i>...It's kicked in!</i>

17:34.400 --> 17:36.400
<i>Goal!</i>

17:36.400 --> 17:38.410
<i>It's a tie!</i>

17:38.410 --> 17:42.280
<i>Just before the match ends,
Tsubasa's forward roll kick became a goal,</i>

17:42.280 --> 17:47.080
<i>and Nankatsu have caught up, tying the score at 2-2!</i>

17:47.080 --> 17:48.960
...did it!

17:48.960 --> 17:50.380
You did it, Tsubasa!

17:50.380 --> 17:51.590
We caught up!

17:51.590 --> 17:52.980
It's a tie...

17:52.980 --> 17:56.970
We were just... just a step away from the win.

17:58.540 --> 18:02.220
<i>If I'd noticed Misaki's jump sooner...</i>

18:02.220 --> 18:03.960
They did it, Boss!

18:03.960 --> 18:04.490
Yeah.

18:04.490 --> 18:06.850
We did it, it's a tie!

18:06.850 --> 18:09.730
<i>That was an otherworldly goal!</i>

18:09.730 --> 18:13.400
<i>It was the 3 aces who scored that one.</i>

18:13.400 --> 18:17.900
<i>They did really well despite their injuries.</i>

18:21.400 --> 18:26.660
<i>If I'd noticed that Wakabayashi was overlapping and stopped him from stealing the ball,</i>

18:26.660 --> 18:29.860
<i>that shot wouldn't have happened...</i>

18:31.140 --> 18:34.800
<i>And the whistle blows, signaling the end of the second half.</i>

18:35.460 --> 18:40.290
<i>After fighting for 40 minutes in total over the first and second half,</i>

18:40.290 --> 18:44.350
<i>we have yet to reach a conclusion for this battle.</i>

18:44.350 --> 18:46.600
<i>There are no penalty shootouts for these finals.</i>

18:46.600 --> 18:50.310
<i>After a 10-minute break, 2 halves of extra time will be played, 5 minutes each.</i>

18:50.310 --> 18:53.540
<i>If a conclusion has yet to be reached then, then there will be</i>

18:53.540 --> 18:56.030
<i>another 2 halves of extra time played, 5 minutes each.</i>

18:56.030 --> 19:01.780
<i>In the event that both teams were to remain tied after
extra time, both teams would be declared champions.</i>

19:01.780 --> 19:03.750
You dropped your guard at the end.

19:03.750 --> 19:05.030
Yes, sir...

19:05.030 --> 19:08.060
But what's done is done.

19:08.060 --> 19:09.210
Don't sweat over it.

19:09.210 --> 19:11.180
Extra time is our main focus now!

19:12.080 --> 19:14.890
Our opponent's 3 aces are all injured.

19:14.890 --> 19:17.460
We have the upper hand overall.

19:17.460 --> 19:18.740
Listen to me!

19:18.740 --> 19:20.020
It's up to your willpower!

19:20.020 --> 19:23.000
If you don't lose in that regard,
you will certainly grasp victory!

19:23.000 --> 19:23.970
Yes!

19:24.550 --> 19:26.970
Misaki, show me your injury.

19:28.220 --> 19:32.270
It'll be hard for us without you,
but you really shouldn't play in the extra time.

19:32.270 --> 19:34.730
Taro, how will it be?

19:34.730 --> 19:36.700
Dad!

19:36.700 --> 19:38.460
Can you do it?
Or can you not?

19:38.460 --> 19:41.360
You must know it best.

19:41.360 --> 19:43.740
It's all right. I can play.

19:43.740 --> 19:49.030
Even you finish all the paintings you start, right, dad?

19:49.030 --> 19:53.750
So if I go out on the pitch in a match,
I'll make sure to play until the end.

19:53.750 --> 19:55.750
Taro...

19:56.920 --> 19:58.750
Let me take over.

19:59.380 --> 20:00.980
Mr. Mikami!

20:02.600 --> 20:05.510
We'll have to make do by taping it with bandages.

20:05.510 --> 20:08.700
Genzo, I know how you feel.

20:08.700 --> 20:10.470
Good luck in the extra time.

20:10.470 --> 20:12.230
Yes!

20:13.050 --> 20:18.070
When I was actively playing,
my trainer would massage me like this, too.

20:18.070 --> 20:21.290
Tsubasa, you did well to score with that last shot.

20:21.290 --> 20:24.480
You always leave me in awe of your play!

20:24.480 --> 20:25.490
Thanks!

20:25.490 --> 20:29.320
Among the three of you, your injury is the least serious.

20:29.320 --> 20:32.160
We have no choice but to make you work hard in extra time.

20:32.160 --> 20:34.160
I know, Roberto.

20:34.160 --> 20:36.310
Nankatsu will definitely win.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.710
And then, we're off to Brazil!

20:39.210 --> 20:41.380
Yeah, I feel you.

20:41.380 --> 20:43.870
But your focus for now should be this match.

20:43.870 --> 20:46.050
Think about how you can win this match.

20:46.050 --> 20:47.800
Yes!

20:47.800 --> 20:51.060
<i>The temperature out here is about 35°C.</i>

20:51.060 --> 20:55.270
<i>The players will have to fight hard in this sweltering heat.</i>

20:55.270 --> 20:59.770
<i>Nankatsu vs. Meiwa's match is about to resume in extra time.</i>

21:00.470 --> 21:01.940
Tsubasa...

21:01.940 --> 21:03.350
Kojiro...

21:03.350 --> 21:05.070
Good luck, Bro!

21:05.620 --> 21:08.870
<i>This time, I'll put an end to this and settle my score with you!</i>

21:09.660 --> 21:11.370
<i>We won't lose to you, Meiwa.</i>

21:11.370 --> 21:13.620
<i>We will win!</i>

21:13.620 --> 21:19.000
<i>The first half of the extra time will start with Meiwa's kick-off.</i>

21:20.790 --> 21:24.840
<i>As usual, the ace of Meiwa, Hyuga, brings the ball forward.</i>

21:24.840 --> 21:27.180
All right, let's go! We'll take that ball!

21:27.180 --> 21:30.810
<i>Nankatsu presses as usual, moving to try and take the ball!</i>

21:31.460 --> 21:33.390
<i>A pass for Sawada!</i>

21:34.060 --> 21:35.770
<i>A one-two by Meiwa!</i>

21:36.280 --> 21:39.710
<i>Since the start of this finals match, Hyuga,
known for his selfish style of play,</i>

21:39.710 --> 21:42.400
<i>has come to rely quite a bit on his teammates!</i>

21:42.400 --> 21:44.030
Kojiro...

21:45.530 --> 21:49.780
<i>Since you're injured, a shot from this distance
ought to be enough to crush you!</i>

21:49.780 --> 21:50.620
What?!

21:50.620 --> 21:54.120
<i>Ah! Will Hyuga really shoot this soon?!</i>

21:54.120 --> 21:55.000
Eat this!

21:55.000 --> 21:58.160
<i>It's a lively shot from an extra-long distance!</i>

21:58.160 --> 21:59.250
Wakabayashi!

21:59.250 --> 22:03.130
<i>Will Wakabayashi be able to stop this ball despite his injured leg?</i>

22:05.270 --> 22:08.920
<i>He got it! Wakabayashi firmly catches the ball!</i>

22:08.920 --> 22:09.800
What?!

22:11.050 --> 22:12.850
You did it, Wakabayashi!

22:12.850 --> 22:20.020
<i>Hyuga, even if my leg breaks, I won't concede another goal to you!</i>

22:20.020 --> 23:50.030
I can't with Kojiro's singing

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.630 --> 22:50.630
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.630 --> 22:50.630
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.630 --> 22:56.640
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.630 --> 22:56.640
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:02.100
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:02.100
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:08.240
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:08.240
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.150 --> 23:14.950
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.150 --> 23:14.950
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:14.950 --> 23:21.000
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.000 --> 23:26.000
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.000 --> 23:26.000
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.300 --> 23:33.180
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.300 --> 23:33.180
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.180 --> 23:39.060
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.060 --> 23:45.940
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.060 --> 23:45.940
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.030 --> 24:00.640
COMING UP, EPISODE 26:
PHANTOM GOAL
